"note": "LAB ZONE until Matt approves its pieces. The Frostline's first screens (docs/vision/regions/home-valley-frostline-brackens.md; game/data/plans/frostline.json): the Col Path in at the south, the Col hut and its yard on the lower shelf, the tarn's outlet under a footbridge, the cirque's granite step climbed by a stair, the frozen tarn with the ice-cut and the ice-cutter's sledge on the upper bench, and the High Fells' moraine where the shardstruck ibex are, under the headwall's crags. Built from the Frostline set's candidate pieces (scripts/art/kit/sets/frost.py). Not in data/zones.json: nothing leads to it yet.",
